# Harvest cache for tools/class-profiles — 2337 raw questlog build records.
#
# NOT committed, deliberately. It is someone else's content plus other players' character names,
# usernames and avatar URLs, and this project already ruled that redistributing another site's data
# outside their own sanctioned mechanism is not granted to us (see the TLDB note in CLAUDE.md). The
# DERIVED aggregate profiles are our own analysis and do ship; the raw records do not.
#
# Rebuilding it is one command and about two minutes:
#   python tools/class-profiles/build-class-profiles.py
tools/class-profiles/harvest-cache.json
